# Cracked Skull: "Enchant creature. When this Aura enters, look at target player's hand. You may choose a nonland card from it.
# That player discards that card." Bot1 puts the Aura on its own Phyrexian Walker, targets Bot2 and looks at its hand: a Lightning
# Bolt, a Counterspell and five Islands. A land can't be chosen; the Bolt is, and Bot2 discards it (it goes to Bot2's graveyard, the
# rest of the hand stays, nobody draws). The Aura stays on the Walker.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Phyrexian Walker
Cracked Skull
Island x3
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island x5
Island x13

